    "markdown": "# pandas.tseries.offsets.Hour.nanos#\n\n- Hour.nanos#\n- Returns an integer of the total number of nanoseconds. See also \n  - `tseries.offsets.Hour.nanos`\n  - Returns an integer of the total number of nanoseconds.\n  - `tseries.offsets.Day.nanos`\n  - Returns an integer of the total number of nanoseconds.\n Examples >>> pd.offsets.Hour(5).nanos 18000000000000",
